inder of the breast tissue contains scattered brown fluid filled cysts  The axillary tail aspect is dissected to reveal no identifiable lymph nodes  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Hemorrhagic cavity with respect to posterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Hemorrhagic cavity with respect to anterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Additional representative sections of the cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of the ill defined abnormally firm area  tumor   including nearest margins   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of breast tissue away from the cavity and tumor   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of breast tissue containing brown fluid filled cyst   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of the axillary tail   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Nipple  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Subareolar tissue  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Tissue superior medial to nipple  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Cavity  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Subareolar fibrocystic changes  Also received in the same container is a 20cm in circumference  0 6cm in width donut shaped piece of skin  The surface of the skin is tan pink and unremarkable  the deep resection margin is dark red  and unremarkable  The deep resection margin is inked black  A representative section of this skin is submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  non sentinel tissue left breast   is an aggregate of fatty tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm  Out of the fat are dissected 5 potential lymph nodes ranging in size from 1 4cm in greatest dimension to 0 4cm in greatest diameter  The largest lymph node is bisected and submitted in toto as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   The remaining lymph nodes are submitted in toto as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   The remainder of the fatty tissue is submitted in toto as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS  FROZEN SEC